OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos killed my mum in her 40s
OL,4,A` was her school to blame?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family blame the local authority
OL,7,Fthat ran Caroline's school for her
OL,8,Fdeath and are taking legal action.
OL,9,FCardiff council said it would be
OL,10,Finappropriate to comment on legal
OL,11,Fproceedings in progress.
